	JMP I	(AGAIN)			/RESTART THERE

WBTOK,	TAD	(-4^200)		/SETUP THE
	DCA	TEMP1			/CLEARING COUNT
	NL7777				/BACKUP
	TAD	WRDPTR			/POINT AT THE READ-BACK BUFFER
	DCA	XR1			/STASH THE POINTER
