	JMS I	[IOHAND]		/CALL I/O HANDLER
WRDPTR,	MSAREA				/TRANSFER ADDRESS
VBTFUN,	4^100+PR2FLD+.-.		/UNIT BITS WILL BE FILLED IN
	FLWBLK				/RECORD POINTER
	JMP	WBTBAD			/BARF!
	TAD	(-4^200)		/SETUP THE
