	NL7777				/BACKUP
	TAD	WRDPTR			/SETUP THE
	DCA	XR2			/READ-BACK POINTER
VBTLUP,	CDF	TBLFLD			/GOTO BUFFER FIELD
	TAD I	XR1			/GET A WORD
	CIA				/INVERT FOR TESTING
	CDF	PR2FLD			/GOTO READ-BACK FIELD
	TAD I	XR2			/COMPARE TO READ-BACK VALUE
	CDF	PR1FLD			/BACK TO OUR FIELD
	SZA CLA				/SKIP IF IT MATCHES
