/	I/O ERROR MODE CHECK ROUTINE.

IOCHECK,.-.			/I/O ERROR CHECK ROUTINE
	TAD	IOSW		/GET MODE SWITCH
	SZA CLA			/SKIP IF IN NORMAL MODE NOW
	JMP I	IOCHECK		/ELSE JUST RETURN
