	TAD	XR1		/POINT TO CORRESPONDING ELEMENT IN SECOND LIST
	DCA	DATSETUP	/STASH THE POINTER
	CDF	PRGFLD		/GOTO CALLING FIELD
	TAD I	[INCHAR]	/GET SECOND CHARACTER
	CDF	MS2FLD		/GOTO TABLE FIELD
	TAD I	DATSETUP	/COMPARE TO SECOND CHARACTER
	SZA CLA			/SKIP IF IT MATCHES
	JMP	SRCHMORE	/JUMP IF NOT THIS ONE
